row data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and verify directly that it minimizes the residual and is the\nshortest minimizer.</p>","file":"ch13-psd-and-svd/12-pseudoinverse.html"}